{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17444","headline":"建除诗 · 权德舆","name":"建除诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"建节出王都，雄雄大丈夫。\n除书加右职，骑吏拥前驱。\n满月张繁弱，含霜耀鹿卢。\n平明跃騕褭，清夜击珊瑚。\n定远功那比，平津策乃迂。\n执心思报国，效节在忘躯。\n破胆销丹浦，颦蛾舞绿珠。\n危冠徒自爱，长毂事应殊。\n成绩封千室，畴劳使五符。\n收功轻骠卫，致埋迈黄虞。\n开济今如此，英威古不侔。\n闭关草玄者，无乃误爲儒。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"权德舆","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_17444.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_17444","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}